      "q": "3. There is great value attached to people who are engaged in community service activities. Comment on this statement.\nCommunity service activities are highly valued because they contribute to the welfare and betterment of society. They strengthen community bonds, address social needs, and improve quality of life. Volunteers and community service workers help those in need, promote social cohesion, and often tackle issues that are not addressed through economic activities. Their efforts enhance social responsibility and create a positive impact on the community, making their contributions invaluable.",
