      "q": "1. How are economic activities classified?",
      "a": "Economic activities are classified into three sectors:\nPrimary Sector\n: Involves the extraction of natural resources, like farming, fishing, and mining.\nSecondary Sector\n: Involves manufacturing and processing activities, such as factories and industries.\nTertiary Sector\n: Involves services like transportation, education, and healthcare."
