      "q": "2. What differentiates these activities to be grouped into sectors?",
      "a": "Economic activities are grouped based on the nature of the work involved:\nThe\nPrimary Sector\ndeals with natural resources.\nThe\nSecondary Sector\ninvolves transforming raw materials into finished goods.\nThe\nTertiary Sector\nprovides services that support the primary and secondary sectors and meet the needs of society."
